SUMMARY:Special Event: Geoffrey Asmus
LOCATION:Helium Comedy Club\, 3070 Windward Plaza\, Portland
DESCRIPTION:Geoffrey Asmus began performing stand-up in 2013 immediately af
 ter wasting $143\,548 in college.\n\nSoon after Geoffrey was selected as a 
 ‘New Face’ performer at Just For Laughs Montreal and featured on FOX’
 s ‘Laughs’ and Kevin Hart’s LOL Network.\n\nGeoffrey is a regular at 
 the world famous Comedy Cellar and has opened for Sam Morril\, Mark Normand
 \, Dan Soder\, Daniel Sloss\, Dave Attell and Ari Shaffir among others. In 
 2021 Geoffrey released his first album “Prodigal Little Bitch” through 
 800lb Gorilla Records. The album went to #1 on iTunes and is played nationw
 ide on SiriusXM radio.\n\nGeoffrey also co-hosts the "You’re An Idiot” 
 podcast which is the only funny podcast and is better than the Joe Rogan Ex
 perience.\n\nOnstage and offstage Geoffrey will not make eye contact\, whic
 h is a blessing for all.\n\nCouple's Package includes:\n\n- 2 premium seats
 \n- $90 food & beverage credit ($45 per person)\n- Gratuity\n- Ticket Prote
 ction\n\nThere is a two-item per person minimum in the Showroom\, which can
  be fulfilled with any food or drink items from the menu.\n\nPLEASE NOTE: F
 ood and drinks purchased in the bar and lounge do not count towards the two
 -item minimum.\n\nManagement reserves the right to prevent customers from e
 ntering the facility who they deem disruptive or dangerous to other patrons
 .\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/special-event-geof
 frey-asmus-21956/
